<title>EGYPT: National Societe Generale to raise capital.</title>
<headline>National Societe Generale to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of National Societe Generale Bank has proposed raising the bank's capital to 120 million pounds ($35 million) from 100 million by issuing one free share for each five, a bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bank would transfer the 20 million pounds from reserves to capital, he added.</p>
<p>The bank has called a meeting of shareholders for March 19 to discuss the proposal.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
